cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, query set or pipeline, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "A Water Law Knowledge Graph for As-Of Legal Retrieval: Water Resources Regulation Across China's 2026 Environmental Codification"
abstract: >-
  Code and data release for a norm-proposition knowledge graph over Chinese water law,
  with an as-of retrieval pipeline and a doubly annotated query set. Six instruments are
  covered (the Ecological Environment Code in force 2026-08-15, the Yangtze River Protection
  Law, the Yellow River Protection Law, the Water Law, the Water Pollution Prevention and
  Control Law as repealed on 2026-08-14, and the Ecological Protection Compensation
  Regulation), holding 2847 provisions and 4161 norm propositions. The query set holds 60
  queries annotated by two annotators at two dates, together with the full adjudication
  record. The pipeline is deterministic, so a re-run reproduces the shipped numbers to the
  last digit.
